  its nonlinear lift is -0.023 against -0.029 for a
  rank-matched random subspace. A quadratic probe -- which CAN read a
  tensor-product code -- finds no more role in J-space than a linear one.
  The multiplicative-encoding escape hatch is closed empirically.
